    "blocks": [
      {
        "id": "p1",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Where do we see hearts? On letters, chocolates, Mother’s Day cards... It’s not the shape of a "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "real",
            "ref": "v-real"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " human heart, but we use it to show love. Well, maybe nature uses the shape, too."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Some "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "miners",
            "zh": "矿工"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " found a rock in "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "Uruguay",
            "zh": "乌拉圭"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". They broke it open. "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "Guess",
            "ref": "v-guess"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " what? There was a heart on both sides!"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Mother "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "Nature",
            "ref": "v-nature"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " had created this lovely purple "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "geode",
            "zh": "晶洞"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " over many, many years. The miners were "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "lucky",
            "ref": "v-lucky"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " to find it. It’s very cute!"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Some people think it might be a "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "sign",
            "zh": "标志"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " of love from the "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "Earth",
            "ref": "v-earth"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". So, "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "in return",
            "ref": "v-in-return"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ", we should show our love for it by "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "protecting",
            "ref": "v-protect"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " nature."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p5",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "This was the first natural heart-shaped geode found in nature. It’s a "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "gift",
            "ref": "v-gift"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " from the Earth!"
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
